SUMMARY:The Weight
LOCATION:Amherst Cinema\, 28 Amity St\, Amherst\, MA 01002
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1:55pm\, 4:35pm\, 7:15pm\, 9:35pm\nWhen Samuel (Ethan Ha
 wke) is torn from his daughter and sent to a brutal prison\, Warden Clancy
  (Russell Crowe) offers him a high-stakes proposition: smuggle gold out of
  a remote mine with a dangerous crew of prisoners and he’ll win his free
 dom.\nhttps://amherstcinema.org/films-and-events/weight\nFrom Pushpin West
 ern Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://amherstcinema.org/films-and-events/weight
