SUMMARY:The Cycle of Love
LOCATION:Amherst Cinema\, 28 Amity St\, Amherst\, MA 01002
DESCRIPTION:In 1977\, PK\, a 23-year-old Delhi street artist from a poor\, 
 ‘untouchable’ family\, picked up a handful of paintbrushes and a secon
 d-hand bicycle and set off on a 6000-mile cross-continent mission—to fin
 d Lotta\, the woman who had captured his heart.\nhttps://amherstcinema.org
 /films-and-events/cycle-love\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.c
 ity/westernma/
URL:https://amherstcinema.org/films-and-events/cycle-love
